{"2926320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Economy World", "steam_appid": 2926320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<strong>Economy world</strong> is a real-time strategy where, together with other players, you try to gain the widest possible market share for your products. <strong>You start with simple grain production or mining resources in a mine</strong> and try to reach the top, which are <strong>bakeries, car or computer factories</strong>. It is up to you what direction your company will go. The game has a <strong>natural supply and demand game</strong>, so other players have an impact on the profits we earn. The raw materials we need can be <strong>on different continents</strong>, then we will be forced to build ports and buy ships that we will transport to our factories.<br><br>Players who join companies take part in <strong>seasonal rankings</strong>, at the end of which they receive prizes thanks to which we will develop our company. The company <strong>offers a whole range of tasks to perform as well as bonuses</strong> thanks to which we will multiply our profits.<br><br><strong>The cars you start the game with are from the 50s</strong>, with the development of technology you will have access to more modern trucks with better parameters. <strong>We can combine vehicles into convoys</strong> thanks to which managing a huge fleet is not a problem. Cars have a wide range of modifications, but first you need to earn points to strengthen them.", "about_the_game": "<strong>Economy world</strong> is a real-time strategy where, together with other players, you try to gain the widest possible market share for your products. <strong>You start with simple grain production or mining resources in a mine</strong> and try to reach the top, which are <strong>bakeries, car or computer factories</strong>. It is up to you what direction your company will go. The game has a <strong>natural supply and demand game</strong>, s